The card utilities, engine, hand recognition/comparison, validation, server plugin,
state types and original 41 hand tests are derived from Tongzhuo and the user's
landlord-fix archive. The supplied fixes to rocket priority, equal sequence length,
integer bidding, duplicate IDs and missing-player view handling are retained.
Changes here adapt imports and injected randomness, and add the Vue UI, platform
account integration, SQLite rooms, request receipts, version checks, tests and docs.

No upstream React/PixiJS runtime, unrelated games, desktop distribution, third-party
audio or artwork is bundled. Card faces are rendered with CSS and Unicode symbols.
This is an independently runnable adaptation, not the upstream project's official release.
